## Translations  
Uses the python packages argostranslate and deep-translator. Only stored on local machine, not deployed to Heroku.
### Translation codes
de - German  
es - Spanish  
fr - French  
it - Italian  
nl - Netherlands 
To compile the trans django.po file
Change the following command as per country required and Run: 
python manage.py makemessages -l nl -e html,py,txt -i venv  
To generate the translations messages
Change translate_po for the required translation code and Run:  
python translate_po.py  
Finally to compile the messages and generate the django.mo binary files run:  
python manage.py compilemessages  
Note  
The bin/post_compile is used to compile the django.mo binary file on deployment to Heroku.